as long  deserved insomniacs goals go even higher  than that however according to in Sahara  and Sami AK wanted this rendition of  Spider Man to be the Iron Man of Marvel  video games we you know some funny thing  that like Marvel and I talked a lot  about is this is the Iron Man this is  the one that's gonna start it off yeah  this is the one that's gonna like the  2008 film starring Robert Downey jr.  into heart hopes spider-man on ps4 would  force people to take future Marvel games  seriously by all accounts it seems  insomniac succeeded spider-man ps4 is  the fastest selling spider-man game ever  it is the best-selling Marvel branded  game of all time and as of this morning  it is the fastest selling first-party  playstation title it's raised  expectations for future Marvel titles  and once again cements insomniac as an  elite triple-a developer between its new  friendship with Marvel its ongoing  success with Sony and a massive  blockbuster hit under its belt I'm  willing to bet that insomniacs days as  the underdog are long gone  [Music]
 

